sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User via Web App
    participant API as :AuthController
    participant Auth as :AuthService
    participant Time as :Clock
    User->>API: login(identifier,password)
    API->>Auth: login(identifier,password)
    Note over Auth: Trim and lowercase the identifier. Preserve password UTF-8 exactly.<br/>Read account and tokenVersion. Verify pre-hashed bcrypt cost 12.<br/>Run dummy bcrypt when the account is absent.
    alt Invalid credential or inactive account
        Auth-->>API: Generic authentication failure
        API-->>User: Generic sign-in error
    else Active account and valid credentials
        Auth->>Time: now()
        Time-->>Auth: iat
        Note over Auth: Sign HS256 JWT with sub, jti, tv, iat and exp.<br/>exp = iat + 24 h. No active-session row is created.
        alt JWT signing fails
            Auth-->>API: Failure
            API-->>User: No authenticated response
        else JWT issued
            Auth-->>API: Signed JWT and safe account summary
            API-->>User: HttpOnly Secure SameSite=Lax cookie and safe account summary
        end
    end
